    "Description": "The libtiff packages contain a library of functions for manipulating Tagged Image File Format (TIFF) files.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libtiff: libtiff: Arbitrary code execution or denial of service via signed integer overflow in TIFF file processing (CVE-2026-4775)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
